8,"Banda, Togbo-Vara in Central African Republic... | Joshua Project",https://joshuaproject.net/people_groups/15529/CT,"Togbo-Vara Banda in Central African Republic PRINT VERSIONThe Banda are the largest group in the Central African Republic (CAR) but they also live in the Democratic Republic of Congo, South Sudan and Cameroon. They are divided by subgroups determined by dialect.","Banda, Togbo-Vara",Niger-Congo
